  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So it seems statuses are reverting back locally, but others can still see the new status, at least from my experience the other day with others being able to react to a funny status I made despite locally, my status was something else rather than what it should have actually been. \n\nIn-game image below shows my status reverted back, other image shows what it should actually be and what others will see.\n\nSteps to repro seem to be...\n1.) Change your status\n2.) Look up at your nameplate to double confirm it has changed (if you have statuses set to always show on nameplate)\n3.) Close menu\n4.) Re-open social menu (at this point, there is a completely random chance your status will revert locally. It seems to be entirely inconsistent)\nRepeat steps 1 - 4 if necessary, it will happen eventually.\nLogs: https://files.catbox.moe/952jfl.zip",
